  {
   "title": "Dub from the Maashaven, with Kofi",
   "category": "maashaven-dub",
   "tags": [
    "Dub",
    "Roots"
   ],
   "image": "turntable.jpg",
   "template": "single-episode",
   "excerpt": "Two hours of steppers and one very long King Tubby version.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:audio -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://stream.example.com/archive/maashaven-dub-2026-09-23.mp3\"></audio><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Maashaven Dub, 23 September, 2 hours</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:audio -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Kofi brought a box of Jah Shaka pressings and played them in order of how scratched they are.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tracklist</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Artist</th><th>Track</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>21:00</td><td>Jah Shaka</td><td>Commandments of Dub</td></tr><tr><td>21:12</td><td>King Tubby</td><td>Declaration of Rights (version)</td></tr><tr><td>21:30</td><td>Mad Professor</td><td>Kunta Kinte Dub</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "Live electronics from Codarts students",
   "category": "klankkast",
   "tags": [
    "Experimental",
    "Live"
   ],
   "image": "laptop.jpg",
   "template": "single-episode",
   "excerpt": "Three students from the sonology course played live on the desk.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:audio -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://stream.example.com/archive/klankkast-2026-09-24.mp3\"></audio><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Klankkast, 24 September, 1 hour 30 minutes</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:audio -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Sem invited three second-year students from Codarts. Each played 30 minutes live. Nobody knew what the others were going to do, including Sem.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tracklist</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Artist</th><th>Track</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>22:00</td><td>Anouk Veld</td><td>Sine study, live</td></tr><tr><td>22:30</td><td>Tariq Haddou</td><td>Feedback in C</td></tr><tr><td>23:00</td><td>Mei Lin</td><td>Havenkraan, live</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "Charity shop finds from Crooswijk",
   "category": "tweede-hands",
   "tags": [
    "Soul",
    "Nederpop"
   ],
   "image": "records.jpg",
   "template": "single-episode",
   "excerpt": "Everything tonight cost €1 or less at the Leger des Heils shop.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:audio -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://stream.example.com/archive/tweede-hands-2026-09-22.mp3\"></audio><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Tweede Hands, 22 September, 2 hours</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:audio -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Jaap spent €14 at the charity shop in Crooswijk and plays all of it, including the one with a coffee ring on side B.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tracklist</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Artist</th><th>Track</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>20:00</td><td>Earth and Fire</td><td>Weekend</td></tr><tr><td>20:08</td><td>Cuby and the Blizzards</td><td>Window of my Eyes</td></tr><tr><td>20:15</td><td>Anita Meyer</td><td>Why Tell Me Why</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "Kaseko for a wet Sunday",
   "category": "zondagse-kaseko",
   "tags": [
    "Kaseko",
    "Surinamese pop"
   ],
   "image": "sax.jpg",
   "template": "single-episode",
   "excerpt": "Ramona plays the records her father brought from Paramaribo in 1975.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:audio -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://stream.example.com/archive/kaseko-2026-09-21.mp3\"></audio><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Zondagse Kaseko, 21 September, 2 hours</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:audio -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">It rained all afternoon, so Ramona played her father's records in the order he packed them in 1975.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tracklist</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Artist</th><th>Track</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>14:00</td><td>Lieve Hugo</td><td>Na Mi Na Yu</td></tr><tr><td>14:09</td><td>Max Nijman</td><td>Wan Bon</td></tr><tr><td>14:20</td><td>Trafassi</td><td>Kaseko Medley</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "Nachtbus, the 3am special",
   "category": "nachtbus",
   "tags": [
    "Ambient",
    "Classical"
   ],
   "image": "cello.jpg",
   "template": "single-episode",
   "excerpt": "For the night shift at the port. Slow cello, rain and the BN bus announcements.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:audio -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://stream.example.com/archive/nachtbus-2026-09-19.mp3\"></audio><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Nachtbus, 19 September, 2 hours</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:audio -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Iris does this one for the people working nights at the port. Slow music and the odd announcement from the night bus.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tracklist</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Artist</th><th>Track</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>23:00</td><td>Arthur Russell</td><td>Tower of Meaning</td></tr><tr><td>23:20</td><td>Hildur Guðnadóttir</td><td>Bathroom Dance</td></tr><tr><td>23:40</td><td>Joep Beving</td><td>Sleeping Lotus</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "Buurtpraat: the new ferry timetable",
   "category": "buurtpraat",
   "tags": [
    "Talk",
    "Katendrecht"
   ],
   "image": "accordion.jpg",
   "template": "single-episode",
   "excerpt": "Neighbours on the Watertaxi changes and what the market is doing about Saturday parking.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:audio -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://stream.example.com/archive/buurtpraat-2026-09-20.mp3\"></audio><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Buurtpraat, 20 September, 1 hour</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:audio -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Four neighbours on the new water taxi timetable, the Saturday market and the plan to close the Rechthuislaan to cars.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tracklist</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Artist</th><th>Track</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>11:00</td><td>Talk</td><td>The water taxi, with Henk from the Kaapse Maria</td></tr><tr><td>11:25</td><td>Doe Maar</td><td>Sinds 1 dag of 2</td></tr><tr><td>11:30</td><td>Talk</td><td>Market parking, with the Deliplein traders</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "Fenna and Ruud with the Feyenoord kit man",
   "category": "ochtend-op-de-kade",
   "tags": [
