   "image": "drummer.jpg",
   "template": "single-episode",
   "excerpt": "Breakfast with the man who washes 400 shirts a week, and six new Dutch releases.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:audio -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://stream.example.com/archive/ochtend-2026-09-25.mp3\"></audio><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Ochtend op de Kade, 25 September, 2 hours</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:audio -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Two hours of breakfast radio. Ruud interviewed the kit man at Feyenoord about washing 400 shirts a week, and Fenna played six new Dutch releases.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tracklist</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Artist</th><th>Track</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>08:05</td><td>Froukje</td><td>Groter Dan Ik</td></tr><tr><td>08:30</td><td>Talk</td><td>The kit man</td></tr><tr><td>09:10</td><td>Goldband</td><td>Noodgeval</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->"
